flowchart TD
    Pol2["RNA Pol II<br/>transcription"]
    Pri["pri-miRNA<br/>stem-loop"]
    Drosha["Microprocessor<br/>Drosha DGCR8"]
    Pre["pre-miRNA<br/>70 nt"]
    Export["Exportin-5<br/>RanGTP"]
    Cyto["Cytoplasm"]
    Dicer["Dicer TRBP"]
    Duplex["miRNA miRNA*<br/>duplex"]
    RISC["AGO2 RISC<br/>mature strand"]
    Target["mRNA silencing<br/>translational block"]
    Pol2 --> Pri
    Pri -->|nucleus| Drosha
    Drosha --> Pre
    Pre --> Export
    Export --> Cyto
    Cyto --> Dicer
    Dicer --> Duplex
    Duplex -->|strand selection| RISC
    RISC --> Target